            "typeClass": "compound",
            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset provides information on weights and measures used by the Dutch East India Company (VOC). The dataset is meant to be integrated into the GLOBALISE infrastructure, to serve as reference data and to facilitate query expansion in full-text searches of the archives of the VOC.\n</p>\n<p>\nThis dataset contextualizes units of weight and measure which were drawn from the eighteenth-century 'Memoriën van Munten, Maaten, en Gewigten als dezelve op Batavia en op de respective Comptoiren van Indië in gebruik zijn'. To (re)use the dataset and to know more about its scope and contents, please consult the documentation and the data-envelope. \n</p>\n<p>\nThe dataset consists of three different files:</br> \nFile 1: Glossary of weights and measures</br>\nFile 2: Labels for weights and measures</br>\nFile 3: Conversions for weights and measures.</br>\nThere are two file types for the conversions (xlsx and tab). The xlsx file gives a  clear overview of the conversions, the tab file is principally meant for re-use.\n\n</p>\n<p>\nThe documents in the current version of the dataset (Version 1) are dated May 2024."
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionDate",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "2024-05-16"
                }
              }
            ]
